{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18546","headline":"除夜侍酒呈诸兄示舍弟 · 欧阳詹","name":"除夜侍酒呈诸兄示舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫叹明朝又一春，相看堪共贵兹身。\n悠悠寰宇同今夜，膝下传杯有几人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}